{"seq":4,"slug":"teleport-and-suspense","title":"Teleport 与 Suspense","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/teleport-and-suspense","wordCount":473,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"teleport-与-suspense\">Teleport 与 Suspense</h1><h2 id=\"打破组件树限制\">打破组件树限制</h2><p>Vue 3 引入了两个内置组件来解决组件渲染位置和异步加载的问题：<code>&lt;Teleport&gt;</code> 将内容渲染到 DOM 树的任意位置，<code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 协调异步组件的加载流程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph ComponentTree[&quot;组件树&quot;]&#10;        App --&gt; Page --&gt; Modal[&quot;Modal 组件&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph DOMTree[&quot;DOM 树&quot;]&#10;        Body[&quot;body&quot;]&#10;        Body --&gt; AppDiv[&quot;#app&quot;]&#10;        Body --&gt; ModalDiv[&quot;#modal-root&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Modal --&gt; |Teleport| ModalDiv\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph ComponentTree[\"组件树\"]\n        App --&gt; Page --&gt; Modal[\"Modal 组件\"]\n    end\n    subgraph DOMTree[\"DOM 树\"]\n        Body[\"body\"]\n        Body --&gt; AppDiv[\"#app\"]\n        Body --&gt; ModalDiv[\"#modal-root\"]\n    end\n    Modal --&gt; |Teleport| ModalDiv</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Teleport</strong>：把内容渲染到组件树之外的 DOM 位置，同时保留组件树中的逻辑父子关系与事件冒泡。</li>\n<li><strong>传送目标</strong>：<code>to</code> 接受 CSS 选择器或 DOM 元素，<code>disabled</code> 可条件性关闭传送回到原位渲染。</li>\n<li><strong>逻辑位置 vs 物理位置</strong>：Teleport 让二者分离——组件数据仍来自声明处，DOM 却落在别处。</li>\n<li><strong>Suspense</strong>：等待异步依赖（顶层 <code>await</code>）就绪期间先展示 <code>#fallback</code>，就绪后切换到 <code>#default</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>嵌套 Suspense</strong>：不同区域可各自管理加载状态，互不阻塞。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"teleport-基础\">Teleport 基础</h2><p><code>&lt;Teleport&gt;</code> 将其内部内容&quot;传送&quot;到目标 DOM 元素中，同时保留组件树中的逻辑父子关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const showModal = ref&lt;boolean&gt;(false);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;button @click=&quot;showModal = true&quot;&gt;打开弹窗&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;Teleport to=&quot;body&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;div v-if=&quot;showModal&quot; class=&quot;modal-overlay&quot; @click.self=&quot;showModal = false&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;div class=&quot;modal-content&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;h2&gt;弹窗标题&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;弹窗内容会被渲染到 body 下，但仍然可以访问父组件的数据。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;showModal: {{ showModal }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;        &lt;button @click=&quot;showModal = false&quot;&gt;关闭&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Teleport&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const showModal = ref&#x3C;boolean>(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;button @click=\"showModal = true\">打开弹窗&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Teleport to=\"body\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div v-if=\"showModal\" class=\"modal-overlay\" @click.self=\"showModal = false\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div class=\"modal-content\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;h2>弹窗标题&#x3C;/h2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>弹窗内容会被渲染到 body 下，但仍然可以访问父组件的数据。&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>showModal: {{ showModal }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;button @click=\"showModal = false\">关闭&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Teleport></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"teleport-属性\">Teleport 属性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>to</code></td>\n<td><code>string | HTMLElement</code></td>\n<td>目标容器（CSS 选择器或 DOM 元素）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>disabled</code></td>\n<td><code>boolean</code></td>\n<td>禁用传送，内容在原位渲染</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const isMobile = ref&lt;boolean&gt;(window.innerWidth &lt; 768);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 移动端在原位渲染，桌面端传送到 body --&gt;&#10;  &lt;Teleport to=&quot;body&quot; :disabled=&quot;isMobile&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;div class=&quot;sidebar&quot;&gt;侧边栏内容&lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Teleport&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const isMobile = ref&#x3C;boolean>(window.innerWidth &#x3C; 768);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- 移动端在原位渲染，桌面端传送到 body --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Teleport to=\"body\" :disabled=\"isMobile\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div class=\"sidebar\">侧边栏内容&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Teleport></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多个-teleport-到同一目标\">多个 Teleport 到同一目标</h3><p>多个 <code>&lt;Teleport&gt;</code> 可以传送到同一目标，按顺序追加：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;Teleport to=&quot;#notifications&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;div class=&quot;toast&quot;&gt;通知 1&lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Teleport&gt;&#10;  &lt;Teleport to=&quot;#notifications&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;div class=&quot;toast&quot;&gt;通知 2&lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Teleport&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Teleport to=\"#notifications\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div class=\"toast\">通知 1&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Teleport></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Teleport to=\"#notifications\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div class=\"toast\">通知 2&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Teleport></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"teleport-实战场景\">Teleport 实战场景</h2><h3 id=\"全局通知系统\">全局通知系统</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- NotificationProvider.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { provide, ref, type InjectionKey } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface Notification {&#10;  id: number;&#10;  message: string;&#10;  type: &#39;success&#39; | &#39;error&#39; | &#39;info&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface NotificationContext {&#10;  notifications: typeof notifications;&#10;  add: (msg: string, type?: Notification[&#39;type&#39;]) =&gt; void;&#10;  remove: (id: number) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export const NotificationKey: InjectionKey&lt;NotificationContext&gt; = Symbol();&#10;&#10;const notifications = ref&lt;Notification[]&gt;([]);&#10;let nextId = 0;&#10;&#10;function add(message: string, type: Notification[&#39;type&#39;] = &#39;info&#39;) {&#10;  const id = nextId++;&#10;  notifications.value.push({ id, message, type });&#10;  setTimeout(() =&gt; remove(id), 3000);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function remove(id: number) {&#10;  notifications.value = notifications.value.filter((n) =&gt; n.id !== id);&#10;}&#10;&#10;provide(NotificationKey, { notifications, add, remove });&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;slot /&gt;&#10;  &lt;Teleport to=&quot;body&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;div class=&quot;notification-container&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;TransitionGroup name=&quot;notification&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;div v-for=&quot;n in notifications&quot; :key=&quot;n.id&quot; :class=&quot;[&#39;notification&#39;, `notification--${n.type}`]&quot;&gt;&#10;          {{ n.message }}&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      &lt;/TransitionGroup&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Teleport&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- NotificationProvider.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { provide, ref, type InjectionKey } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Notification {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  message: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type: 'success' | 'error' | 'info';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface NotificationContext {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  notifications: typeof notifications;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  add: (msg: string, type?: Notification['type']) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  remove: (id: number) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const NotificationKey: InjectionKey&#x3C;NotificationContext> = Symbol();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const notifications = ref&#x3C;Notification[]>([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let nextId = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function add(message: string, type: Notification['type'] = 'info') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const id = nextId++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  notifications.value.push({ id, message, type });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setTimeout(() => remove(id), 3000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function remove(id: number) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  notifications.value = notifications.value.filter((n) => n.id !== id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide(NotificationKey, { notifications, add, remove });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;slot /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Teleport to=\"body\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div class=\"notification-container\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;TransitionGroup name=\"notification\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div v-for=\"n in notifications\" :key=\"n.id\" :class=\"['notification', `notification--${n.type}`]\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          {{ n.message }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/TransitionGroup></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Teleport></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"suspense-深入\">Suspense 深入</h2><h3 id=\"异步-setup\">异步 setup</h3><p>使用顶层 <code>await</code> 的组件会被视为异步组件，必须由 <code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 包裹：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- AsyncProfile.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;interface UserProfile {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  avatar: string;&#10;  bio: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const res = await fetch(&#39;/api/profile&#39;);&#10;const profile: UserProfile = await res.json();&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div class=&quot;profile&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;img :src=&quot;profile.avatar&quot; :alt=&quot;profile.name&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;h2&gt;{{ profile.name }}&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;{{ profile.bio }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- AsyncProfile.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface UserProfile {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  avatar: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bio: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const res = await fetch('/api/profile');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const profile: UserProfile = await res.json();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div class=\"profile\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;img :src=\"profile.avatar\" :alt=\"profile.name\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;h2>{{ profile.name }}&#x3C;/h2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;p>{{ profile.bio }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"fallback-内容\">fallback 内容</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;AsyncProfile /&gt;&#10;    &lt;template #fallback&gt;&#10;      &lt;div class=&quot;skeleton&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;div class=&quot;skeleton-avatar&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;div class=&quot;skeleton-text&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;div class=&quot;skeleton-text short&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;AsyncProfile /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #fallback></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div class=\"skeleton\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div class=\"skeleton-avatar\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div class=\"skeleton-text\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div class=\"skeleton-text short\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"嵌套-suspense\">嵌套 Suspense</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;template #default&gt;&#10;      &lt;AsyncLayout&gt;&#10;        &lt;!-- 内层 Suspense 独立管理自己的异步状态 --&gt;&#10;        &lt;Suspense&gt;&#10;          &lt;AsyncContent /&gt;&#10;          &lt;template #fallback&gt;&#10;            &lt;p&gt;内容加载中...&lt;/p&gt;&#10;          &lt;/template&gt;&#10;        &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;/AsyncLayout&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;    &lt;template #fallback&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;布局加载中...&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #default></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;AsyncLayout></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;!-- 内层 Suspense 独立管理自己的异步状态 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;AsyncContent /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;template #fallback></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;p>内容加载中...&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/AsyncLayout></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #fallback></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p>布局加载中...&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S1[&quot;外层 Suspense&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; |就绪| Layout[&quot;AsyncLayout&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; |未就绪| F1[&quot;布局加载中...&quot;]&#10;    Layout --&gt; S2[&quot;内层 Suspense&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; |就绪| Content[&quot;AsyncContent&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; |未就绪| F2[&quot;内容加载中...&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    S1[\"外层 Suspense\"]\n    S1 --&gt; |就绪| Layout[\"AsyncLayout\"]\n    S1 --&gt; |未就绪| F1[\"布局加载中...\"]\n    Layout --&gt; S2[\"内层 Suspense\"]\n    S2 --&gt; |就绪| Content[\"AsyncContent\"]\n    S2 --&gt; |未就绪| F2[\"内容加载中...\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h2><p><code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 本身不处理错误，需要配合 <code>onErrorCaptured</code> 或 <code>&lt;ErrorBoundary&gt;</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref, onErrorCaptured } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const error = ref&lt;Error | null&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;onErrorCaptured((err) =&gt; {&#10;  error.value = err as Error;&#10;  return false;&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div v-if=&quot;error&quot; class=&quot;error-state&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;加载失败：{{ error.message }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;button @click=&quot;error = null&quot;&gt;重试&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;Suspense v-else&gt;&#10;    &lt;AsyncPage /&gt;&#10;    &lt;template #fallback&gt;&#10;      &lt;LoadingSkeleton /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref, onErrorCaptured } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const error = ref&#x3C;Error | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onErrorCaptured((err) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  error.value = err as Error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div v-if=\"error\" class=\"error-state\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;p>加载失败：{{ error.message }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button @click=\"error = null\">重试&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Suspense v-else></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;AsyncPage /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #fallback></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;LoadingSkeleton /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>&lt;Teleport&gt;</code> 将内容渲染到 DOM 的任意位置，适用于弹窗、通知、全局浮层等场景</li>\n<li><code>to</code> 属性接受 CSS 选择器或 DOM 元素，<code>disabled</code> 可条件性禁用传送</li>\n<li>多个 <code>&lt;Teleport&gt;</code> 可传送到同一目标，按声明顺序追加</li>\n<li><code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 协调异步组件（顶层 <code>await</code>）的加载状态，通过 <code>#fallback</code> 显示加载 UI</li>\n<li>嵌套 <code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 允许不同区域独立管理各自的异步加载状态</li>\n<li>错误处理需配合 <code>onErrorCaptured</code> 实现，<code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 本身不捕获错误</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Teleport 与 Suspense","id":"teleport-与-suspense"},{"level":2,"text":"打破组件树限制","id":"打破组件树限制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Teleport 基础","id":"teleport-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"Teleport 属性","id":"teleport-属性"},{"level":3,"text":"多个 Teleport 到同一目标","id":"多个-teleport-到同一目标"},{"level":2,"text":"Teleport 实战场景","id":"teleport-实战场景"},{"level":3,"text":"全局通知系统","id":"全局通知系统"},{"level":2,"text":"Suspense 深入","id":"suspense-深入"},{"level":3,"text":"异步 setup","id":"异步-setup"},{"level":3,"text":"fallback 内容","id":"fallback-内容"},{"level":3,"text":"嵌套 Suspense","id":"嵌套-suspense"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动态组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/dynamic-components"},"next":{"title":"Pinia 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/state-management/pinia-fundamentals"}}